# spec: a sidetone mode outside 0-3 reads as unknown(N), keeping the byte so the reader can see what the headphones sent.
# source: synthetic; the captured [1.11] layout (01 02 0f) with mode 7; the result text is INTERFACE.md's for sidetone
device qc_ultra2
call sidetone
send 01 0b 01 00
recv 01 0b 03 03 01 07 0f
result ok unknown(7)
